1. Patient Record Hashing

Class Patient:
    Attributes:
        id
        name
        age
        diagnosis

Initialize Map patientMap  // Key: patient ID, Value: Patient object

Function addPatient(patient):
    patientMap[patient.id] = patient

Function getPatient(id):
    If id exists in patientMap:
        Return patientMap[id]
    Else:
        Return "Patient not found"

Function updatePatient(id, updatedInfo):
    If id exists in patientMap:
        Update patientMap[id] with updatedInfo
    Else:
        Return "Patient not found"

Function deletePatient(id):
    If id exists in patientMap:
        Remove patientMap[id]
    Else:
        Return "Patient not found"

2. Maze Solver Bot

Function solveMaze(maze, x, y, solution):
    If (x, y) is outside maze bounds OR maze[x][y] is blocked:
        Return false

    If (x, y) is the destination:
        Mark solution[x][y] = 1
        Return true

    If maze[x][y] is already visited:
        Return false

    Mark solution[x][y] = 1  // Choose this cell

    // Try moving in all directions
    If solveMaze(maze, x+1, y, solution): Return true  // Down
    If solveMaze(maze, x, y+1, solution): Return true  // Right
    If solveMaze(maze, x-1, y, solution): Return true  // Up
    If solveMaze(maze, x, y-1, solution): Return true  // Left

    Mark solution[x][y] = 0  // Backtrack
    Return false
